+// sysctl debug.wextccold: read = bits 0 TRTD, 1 D3C._STA, 2 IOM TD3C, 3 TXHC answers (VDID != ~0), 4 TXHC.SD3C,
+// 8 last _OFF/_ON evaluation failed; write 1 = evaluate D3C._OFF (no USB-C device should be attached), 0 = D3C._ON.
+// Nothing is evaluated until the sysctl is written; read only evaluates integers (_STA, fields).
