+// in the root scope, so TRTD is inferred from TCOF/TCON, which the SSDT defines only under If (TRTD).
+// Read bits: 0 PC00.TCOF exists, 1 PC00.TCON exists, 2 IOM TD3C, 3 TXHC answers (VDID != ~0), 4 TXHC.SD3C, 8 last call
+// failed. Write 1 = PC00.TCOF (TC-cold entry), 0 = PC00.TCON (exit).
